# Escape leaves the language page, SaveAnywhere: ON (fixtures/langesc:
# sound's lba.cfg with the key). From the main menu's Options Menu, its
# fourth entry here, Choose language: the texts in French, then Escape
# goes back to the options, in French, as Return to previous menu does,
# and Escape again to the main menu.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot page
key Down Right
sleep 3
shot fr
key Escape
sleep 3
shot options2
key Escape
sleep 3
shot main
